WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:04,330
How come your mother works as a cleaner in this five-star hotel?

2
00:00:04,330 --> 00:00:06,460
It's a long story

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,460
This hotel was built by several joint ventures in the early years.

4
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,460
My dad was also one of the partners back then.

5
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,460
Accounted for 0.5% of the shares

6
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,460
0.5 percent?

7
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:16,460
The total assets of this five-star hotel are at least 5 billion

8
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:19,460
0.5% of the shares are worth 25 million

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,480
Later my parents divorced

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:26,060
My dad gave this 0.5% share to my mom

11
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:32,220
My mother took me back to Shonan

12
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,220
I had a piercing experience working in a hotel

13
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,220
As a result, the current major shareholder

14
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,220
The shares sent to my mother

15
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,220
I want to use one phase of tens of millions to forcefully purchase it at a low price.

16
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,510
My mother is willing to sell her life or death

17
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:44,510
Just use your power to squeeze her out like crazy

18
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:46,510
Force her to work as a cleaner cleaning toilets

19
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:47,510
Staring directly at the supervisor every day for no reason
